Usage: agent-deck switch <query> [--json] [--no-attach] [--wait <duration>]

Show a session in the AgentDeck app (or this terminal). <query> is an id, an id prefix, a title or part of one; group names count too.
  -json
    	print one JSON object; never attaches in the terminal
  -no-attach
    	do not attach in this terminal when the app is not reached
  -wait duration
    	how long to wait for the app to acknowledge (at most 2m0s) (default 2s)
